<title>USA: F &amp; M Bancorporation sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>F &amp; M Bancorporation sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>KAUKAUNA, Wis. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>F &amp; M Bancorporation Inc on Wednesday said it declared a 10 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be paid on June 9 to shareholders of record on May 23.</p>
<p>F &amp; M Bancorporation is a multibank holding company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
